graph TD
    Start[Agent Action Step] --> Pusher{EndoscopeBurstPusher Script}
    Pusher --> |Apply base duration| Push[Push 1.0s + Uniform Jitter]
    Push --> ApplyForce[Apply 2 cm/s Forward Velocity along Spline]
    
    ApplyForce --> CollisionCheck{IsTouchingBlockingLayers?}
    CollisionCheck -->|Yes - Wall Scrape| Blocked[Reward = -1.0<br/>Terminate Episode]
    CollisionCheck -->|No| Pause[Pause 4.0s + Uniform Jitter]
    
    Pause --> AgentControl[Agent Steers Tip via 5-Discrete Action Branch]
    AgentControl --> |Action 0..4| Driver[EndoscopeActionDriver]
    Driver --> Torque[Apply Rotational Torque Vector]
